Output Explanation:
It loads the native OpenCV library to use Java API. An instance of CascadeClassifier is created, passing it the name of the file from which the classifier is loaded.Next, the detectMultiScale method is used on the classifier passing it the given image and MatOfRect object.MatOfRect is responsible to do face detections after processing.The process is iterated for doing all the face detections and marking the image with rectangles and at the end, the image is saved as an "output.png" file.
